{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:2.40.100","page_type":"section"},"citation":"2.40.100","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.100","content_hash":"bae50fb99d9d2fbc116e0123748f6908d7335709e45399a696b44c8523f2cb5c","heading":"Municipal Court – Courtroom, supplies, records – Sessions, time, place.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.100:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.100","text":"The Governing Body of the City shall provide at the expense of the City a suitable courtroom for the Municipal Court, together with all necessary supplies and records. Municipal Court shall be held at such time and places designated by the Municipal Judge. (Ord. 20206 § 9, 9-10-19; Ord. 17666 § 9, 3-27-01. Code 1995 § 50-44. Formerly 2.110.100.)\nCross References: City Council – Mayor, Chapter 2.15 TMC.\nState Law References: Similar State statute, K.S.A. 12-4109 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"63be45ba-02e6-56fe-99af-1f2c2eff8efd"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.100","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.100","content_hash":"d11ef367685aff0efeb906ebc35ea58df5cebd0ecac1dc3a10d867b658aaa345","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.100:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.100:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.100","text":"The Governing Body of the City shall provide at the expense of the City a suitable courtroom for the Municipal Court, together with all necessary supplies and records. Municipal Court shall be held at such time and places designated by the Municip